# All six locales

posty.now locales are `en`, `ro`, `de`, `it`, `fr`, `es`. Any user-facing change — UI strings, legal pages, the user guide, emails, assistant/lead-agent copy, errors — must be written in all six. Do not ship Romanian and English and leave the rest on an English fallback.

Match existing nav labels in that locale. Do not mention Zernio in the UI.
